@startuml
title RNF4 — JWT RSA, refresh rotativo em cookie __Host- · Diagrama de sequência
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
autonumber
actor "Visitante (não autenticado)" as Visitante
actor "Head coach / manager (usuário autenticado)" as Manager
participant "Frontend" as Frontend
boundary "Filtros" as Filtros
boundary "API" as API
control "UseCase" as UseCase
control "AuditService" as AuditService
database "MySQL 8" as MySQL
database "Redis 7" as Redis
Visitante -> Frontend: login
Frontend -> API: POST /auth/login (credentials: include)
API -> UseCase: LoginUseCase.execute
UseCase -> UseCase: TokenService: access RS256 15 min (sid = família) · refresh opaco 256 bits
UseCase -> MySQL: INSERT user_session (refreshTokenHash, familyId, ip, userAgent, expiresAt)
UseCase -> Redis: SET session:family:{sid} TTL 7 d
UseCase -> AuditService: ok(LOGIN_OK)
API --> Frontend: 200 {accessToken, expiresIn} + Set-Cookie __Host-scores_af_rt HttpOnly Secure SameSite=Strict Path=/
Frontend -> Frontend: access só em memória (nada em localStorage)
Manager -> Frontend: usa o app (access expira em 15 min)
Frontend -> API: GET /careers (Bearer expirado)
API --> Frontend: 401 UNAUTHENTICATED (RFC 7807, correlationId)
Frontend -> API: POST /auth/refresh (cookie enviado pelo navegador, Origin)
API -> Filtros: Origin / Sec-Fetch-Site same-origin?
alt sem cookie ou Origin estranho
  Filtros --> Frontend: 401 / 403 CSRF_REJECTED
else senão
  API -> UseCase: RefreshTokenUseCase.execute(cookie, ip, userAgent)
  UseCase -> MySQL: findByRefreshTokenHash(hash)
  alt replacedBy preenchido (reuso) ou revogada/expirada
    UseCase -> MySQL: revokeFamily(familyId)
    UseCase -> Redis: DEL session:family:{sid}
    UseCase -> AuditService: failed(TOKEN_REUSE_DETECTED)
    API --> Frontend: 401 + Set-Cookie Max-Age=0
  else senão
    UseCase -> MySQL: UPDATE user_session SET replacedBy = nova WHERE id = antiga AND replacedBy IS NULL
    UseCase -> MySQL: INSERT nova user_session (mesma família)
    UseCase -> AuditService: ok(TOKEN_REFRESHED)
    API --> Frontend: 200 novo access + novo cookie __Host-
    Frontend -> API: reenvia GET /careers
    API --> Frontend: 200
  end
end
Manager -> Frontend: sair
Frontend -> API: POST /auth/logout
API -> UseCase: LogoutUseCase.execute(sid)
UseCase -> MySQL: UPDATE revokedAt WHERE familyId = sid
UseCase -> Redis: DEL session:family:{sid}
API --> Frontend: 204 + Set-Cookie Max-Age=0
Frontend -> Frontend: BroadcastChannel logout → outras abas limpam o access
@enduml
